[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key\nis in OFF position, then disconnect the battery negative terminal\n(-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428180\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429602\">7040L22</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429603\">7040L28</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429601\">7040L20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Loosen adjustment nut (1a), then disconnect cables (1b) from\nthe mount.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection from the handbrake &#x27;on&#x27;\nwarning light switch.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Handbrake switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428465\">I40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Raise the handbrake gaiter as far as necessary.</p><p>4. Undo the bolts (4a) and remove the handbrake lever (4b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044802.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the handbrake lever and\ntighten the bolts to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>HANDBRAKE LEVER</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Bodyshell side ) 2.4 ÷ 3.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nhandbrake &#x27;on&#x27; warning light switch.</p><p>Connect the cables to the mount.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429208\">3380A04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429601\">7040L20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429603\">7040L28</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429602\">7040L22</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p>"]]